        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pig iron, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pig iron, at plant
Inputs and air emissions from different sources. Transports of iron ore calculated according to information about exports and imports.;
Synonyms: hot metal; 
UUID: 92417cb5-1ab5-30a1-b031-33f75b60d41b
Blast furnace process. Emissions are abated
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Blast furnace process
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 5.30E11 kg/a
Sampling: Main in- and outputs based on world average, emissions based on some plants in the EU. Everything based on literature. 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_92417cb5-1ab5-30a1-b031-33f75b60d41b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
